    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事で忙しくなってきたけど、\r\n学校との両立は大変じゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030090010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いえっ、スッゴく楽しいですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010030"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "アイドルのお仕事も、\r\n学校のお勉強もあたしには大切なことですし……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローなら、どっちもがんばらないといけませんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか。まあ、無理はしないようにな\r\nきつくなったら、すぐに言うんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　今は元気いっぱいですけど……\r\nそのときはちゃんと言いますね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。俺でもいいし、家族にでもいい\r\nひとりで抱え込まないようにな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば、最近ご両親と仕事の話をすることはあったか？\r\n相変わらず応援してもらってるのかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。お父さんもお母さんも、\r\nあたしのお仕事が増えると、うれしそうにしてくれます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この間なんて、お母さんが――あっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？\r\n……ああ、子犬か。この辺、散歩させてる人多いんだよな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちっちゃいしっぽをふりふりしてて――\r\nスッゴくかわいいですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな\r\n果穂は犬が好きなのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。あたしのうちにも、\r\nとってもかわいいマメ丸がいるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "マメ丸……？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ、えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010110"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white1",
