  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "stillCtrl": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか\r\nじゃあ、もう兄弟みたいなものだな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。……マメ丸のお散歩を、\r\nプロデューサーさんともできたら楽しいだろうなぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんなら、マメ丸とすぐ仲良くなれますよっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだとうれしいな\r\n俺も、会えるのを楽しみにしておくよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　だってマメ丸は、本当に良い子ですからっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……マメ丸と果穂は、似てるのかもしれないな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっ？　どうしてですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂も元気いっぱいで、人懐っこいじゃないか\r\nそういうところが似てるかなって",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そう、なんでしょうか……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010190"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あ、でも……確かに似てるかも！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁっ！　気づきませんでした！　そっか、\r\nあたしとマメ丸って同じところがあるんですね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ！　さすがプロデューサーさんっ！\r\nあたしのこと、あたしよりよく知ってくれてます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなに褒めてもらうことでもないけど……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いえ、プロデューサーさんはやっぱりスゴいですっ！\r\nえへへ、そっかあ……似てるんですね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（果穂は本当にマメ丸が大好きなんだな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今度、マメ丸と一緒に写真撮影とかをしてみても\r\nいいかもしれないな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしとマメ丸で……？\r\nわあ、プロデューサーさん、それ、スッゴく楽しそうです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。そのときは最高のツーショットを見せてくれ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。マメ丸とプロデューサーさんと一緒なら……\r\nあたしはいつだって笑顔になっちゃいますっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900301/2009003010250"
  },
